---
description: SafeCodeAgent Enterprise repository governance
alwaysApply: true
---

Before repository work, read `AGENTS.md`, `.agents/skills/current/SKILL.md`,
`.agents/context/project-context.md`, and `.agents/context/progress.json`
completely. Follow the context routing table before scanning code or plans.

`AGENTS.md` is the canonical repository rule source. Do not duplicate, weaken,
or work around it in tool-specific rules. Preserve unrelated working-tree
changes, keep temporary artifacts untracked, and never weaken security gates or
tests to complete a task. Update `progress.json` for every progress-bearing task
using the protocol in `AGENTS.md`.
